zip (kuba--/zip) and miniz
https://github.com/kuba--/zip
https://github.com/richgel999/miniz

Vendored under sources/zip/ as zip.h / zip.cpp with miniz.h bundled inside.
This file collects the notices that apply to them so that they can be shipped
alongside the binaries; it is not part of either upstream's file layout.

zip is MIT; miniz is public domain under the Unlicense and additionally
carries an MIT notice on its compression sections. All three texts follow.

